(
    title: "H.E.R.O.",
    developer: Some("John Van Ryzin"),
    description: Some("Volcanic activity has trapped miners deep inside Mount Leone, and Roderick Hero flies down the shafts after them on a propeller backpack. A helmet-mounted microlaser burns through walls and picks off the bats, spiders and snakes infesting the mine, six sticks of dynamite per level blast what the beam is too slow to cut, and every movement drains a power gauge that has to last until the miner is reached."),
